### Group money (stage 4): claims, payment info, receipts.

### Per item from a receipt: the server derives the splits; an item without members (tax) is spread in proportion
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "77777777-7777-4777-8777-777777777773",
  "amountMinor": 286000,
  "currency": "IDR",
  "spentAt": "2026-11-21T12:00:00Z",
  "items": [
    { "name": "Nasi campur", "amountMinor": 130000, "memberIds": ["paste member id", "paste other member id"] },
    { "name": "Sate lilit", "amountMinor": 130000, "memberIds": ["paste third member id"] },
    { "name": "Pajak", "amountMinor": 26000 }
  ]
}

### "Saya sudah bayar": the caller's member paid the receiver; counts once confirmed
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/settlements/claim
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "id": "77777777-7777-4777-8777-777777777774", "toMemberId": "paste member id", "amountMinor": 300000 }

### The receiver confirms (or the OWNER for a receiver without an account)
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/settlements/77777777-7777-4777-8777-777777777774/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The money never arrived: the receiver removes the claim
DELETE {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/settlements/77777777-7777-4777-8777-777777777774
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### "Bayar ke": amount and the receiver's payment info, only while the caller's member owes them
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/settlements/{{myMemberId}}/paste-receiver-member-id/pay-info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Account → Info pembayaran
GET {{host}}/me/payment-methods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/me/payment-methods
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "kind": "BANK", "provider": "BCA", "accountNumber": "1234 5678 90", "holderName": "Septian Nugraha", "isPrimary": true }

### Read a receipt photo (1 credit; nothing when unreadable). Body = the image, at most 5 MB
POST {{host}}/receipts/parse?tripId={{tripId}}
Content-Type: image/jpeg
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

< ./receipt.jpg
